{"file":"Propper-1.1.0-v1.zip","bytes":152856,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"propper","description":"Create, send, and track agreements for e-signature — generate documents from templates, place signature fields, route for signing, and monitor status.","version":"1.1.0","license":"Apache-2.0","repository":"https://github.com/mypropper/skills","homepage":"https://propper.ai","keywords":["e-signature","document signing","agreements","contracts","templates","PDF","document generation","contract workflow"]}],"skills":[{"path":".agents/skills/contribute-propper-skill/SKILL.md","name":"contribute-propper-skill","description":"Add or change a skill in the mypropper/skills plugin and open a PR that passes CI. Use when working inside this repo — writing a new skill, editing an existing SKILL.md or reference, adding an eval case, touching a manifest, or preparing a pull request here.","headings":["Contributing to mypropper/skills","Before you finish, run these","Adding a skill","The description is the trigger surface","Rules CI enforces","Rules CI cannot check","Eval cases","Pull requests","Repo map"],"name_hint":"contribute · propper · 技能","description_zh":"在 mypropper/skills 插件仓库中新增或修改技能、参考资料、评估及 manifest，并创建满足 CI 要求的 PR。"},{"path":".claude/skills/contribute-propper-skill/SKILL.md","name":"contribute-propper-skill","description":"Add or change a skill in the mypropper/skills plugin and open a PR that passes CI. Use when working inside this repo — writing a new skill, editing an existing SKILL.md or reference, adding an eval case, touching a manifest, or preparing a pull request here.","headings":["Contributing to mypropper/skills","Before you finish, run these","Adding a skill","The description is the trigger surface","Rules CI enforces","Rules CI cannot check","Eval cases","Pull requests","Repo map"],"name_hint":"contribute · propper · 技能","description_zh":"在 mypropper/skills 插件仓库中新增或修改技能、参考资料、评估及 manifest，并创建满足 CI 要求的 PR。"},{"path":"skills/agreement-starter-pack/SKILL.md","name":"agreement-starter-pack","description":"Install a library of ready-to-use agreement templates — mutual and one-way NDA, contractor and consulting agreements, SOW, MSA, offer letter, waiver, and settlement release. Use when someone needs a template for a common agreement, has no templates set up yet, asks for a standard NDA or contract to start from, or wants a reusable template library rather than a one-off document.","headings":["Agreement starter pack","File shape","Installing","1. Authenticate","2. Pick","3. Check for collisions","4. Create the docgen template","5. Preview","6. Stop at the docgen template","Sending from the pack","Using a template","Without an account","Customising","Not legal advice"],"name_hint":"agreement · starter · pack","description_zh":"安装可复用常见协议模板库，覆盖双向或单向NDA、承包和咨询协议、SOW、MSA、录用函、豁免及和解解除文件；用于尚无模板或需要模板库而非单份文件。"},{"path":"skills/agreement-workflows/SKILL.md","name":"agreement-workflows","description":"Shared vocabulary for agreement work — recipient roles and signing order, the confirmation wording required before anything that emails a signer or destroys data, and the boundary between extracting facts and giving legal advice. Referenced by the other Propper skills; not invoked directly.","headings":["Agreement workflows","Recipients","Signing order","Confirmation before irreversible actions","Not legal advice"],"name_hint":"agreement · 流程","description_zh":"为其他Propper技能提供协议工作的共用概念，包括收件人角色、签署顺序、发送签署邮件或破坏数据前的确认措辞，以及事实抽取与法律建议的边界；不直接调用。"},{"path":"skills/build-gen-template/SKILL.md","name":"build-gen-template","description":"Turn a document that gets rewritten for every customer into a reusable template — find the values that change between copies, replace them with merge fields, declare the data behind them, and embed signature anchors so generated copies can go straight out for signature. Use when someone retypes the same contract, offer letter or statement of work each time, asks to templatize or parameterize a document, wants a reusable version of something they already have, or needs the same paperwork produced for many parties.","headings":["Build a generation template","Steps","1. Authenticate","2. Choose the engine","3. Separate what varies from what does not","4. Write the placeholders","5. Embed the signature anchors","6. Declare the schema and the defaults","7. Create it","8. Preview it before anyone relies on it","9. Iterate","Coming from DocuSign","Failure handling","Boundary"],"name_hint":"构建 · gen · template","description_zh":"把每位客户都需重写的文档转为可复用模板，识别变化值、替换合并字段、声明数据结构并嵌入签名锚点，适用于合同、录用函、工作说明及批量文件。"},{"path":"skills/compare-contract-versions/SKILL.md","name":"compare-contract-versions","description":"Compare two versions of the same agreement and report exactly what changed — clauses added, removed or reworded, altered amounts, dates and party names, renumbered sections, and changes to the signature blocks. Use when someone has a revised draft, a counterparty's markup or a redline, when they ask what changed, what came back different, whether their edits survived, or what the other side quietly altered.","headings":["Compare contract versions","Steps","1. Establish which version is which","2. Extract the text before comparing","3. Align by clause, not by line","4. Classify every difference","5. Report","Look hardest at these","Limits — state them rather than guessing","Boundary"],"name_hint":"compare · contract · versions","description_zh":"比较同一协议的两版文本，准确汇报条款增删或改写、金额日期及当事人变化、章节重编号和签署区变化，用于对方修订稿及红线核对。"},{"path":"skills/embed-signing-in-your-app/SKILL.md","name":"embed-signing-in-your-app","description":"Build e-signature into an application — authenticate against the API, create an agreement and place fields from code, let a user sign inside your own UI instead of leaving for email, and receive signed-and-completed events on a verified webhook endpoint. Use when someone is adding document signing to a product, wiring up a signing API or webhook listener, asks how to embed a signing ceremony, needs to know when a document completes, or is porting an existing DocuSign integration.","headings":["Embed signing in your app","The two hosts","1. Authenticate","2. Create, populate and send","3. Embed the ceremony","4. Receive events","5. Handle failure like an integration, not like a script","Boundary"],"name_hint":"embed · signing · in · your · app","description_zh":"在应用内嵌入电子签署流程，通过API认证、创建协议及字段，让用户在本产品界面签署，并以验证过的webhook接收签署完成事件；也适用于迁移DocuSign集成。"},{"path":"skills/extract-contract-dates/SKILL.md","name":"extract-contract-dates","description":"Pull every date, deadline and notice window out of an agreement and turn them into a dated list — effective date, term and expiry, auto-renewal with the notice deadline that precedes it, termination rights, cure periods, and payment or delivery milestones. Use when someone asks when a contract renews or expires, what the notice period is, what they need to put in a calendar, how long they have to get out of something, or wants the deadlines pulled out of a stack of contracts.","headings":["Extract contract dates","Steps","1. Read the documents","2. Find the anchor dates","3. Find the durations and what each attaches to","4. Compute the derived deadlines, and show the arithmetic","5. Report as a dated list","The auto-renewal trap","Across many contracts","Boundary"],"name_hint":"extract · contract · dates","description_zh":"从协议提取日期、期限和通知窗口，整理生效、届满、自动续期前通知、终止、补救期及付款交付里程碑，适用于日历整理或批量合同期限盘点。"},{"path":"skills/generate-document/SKILL.md","name":"generate-document","description":"Produce a finished document from a reusable template and a set of values — fill a contract, offer letter, invoice, statement of work or report, check the merged wording before it is committed, and turn a list of rows into one document each. Use when someone wants a document built from a template plus data, asks to fill in, populate or merge a template, has a spreadsheet or list of values that should become documents, or wants the same paperwork produced for many customers.","headings":["Generate a document","Never write the document instead","Steps","1. Authenticate","2. Find the template","3. Map the data onto the schema","4. Preview before you generate","5. Generate","6. Poll, then retrieve","Many documents from one list","Sending what you generated","Failure handling","Boundary"],"name_hint":"生成 · 文档","description_zh":"用模板和数据生成合同、录用函、发票、工作说明或报告，提交前核对合并后的文字，并可将表格每行生成一份文件。"},{"path":"skills/migrate-from-docusign/SKILL.md","name":"migrate-from-docusign","description":"Audit a DocuSign template or envelope export and report exactly what carries over, what changes shape, and what needs rebuilding — then import it. Use when someone has DocuSign template JSON, is evaluating a move off DocuSign, asks what their templates would look like elsewhere, or wants existing envelopes and tabs brought across.","headings":["Migrate from DocuSign","Part 1 — Audit (no account needed)","1. Find the exports","2. Inventory each template","3. Classify","4. Report","Part 2 — Import (needs an account)","5. Authenticate","6. Check for collisions","7. Import","8. Verify","Boundary"],"name_hint":"migrate · from · docusign"},{"path":"skills/place-signature-fields/SKILL.md","name":"place-signature-fields","description":"Work out where signature, initial, date and name fields belong on a document and emit correctly positioned annotations for them. Use when a PDF or DOCX has signature blocks but no fillable fields, when fields land in the wrong place, when a signer has nothing to sign, or when converting signature lines into anchor-based or coordinate-based tabs.","headings":["Place signature fields","Steps","1. Read the document","2. Find the signature blocks","3. Map blocks to recipients","4. Build the annotations","5. Apply","6. Verify before sending","Checks that catch the common failures","Boundary"],"name_hint":"place · signature · fields"},{"path":"skills/propper/SKILL.md","name":"propper","description":"Foundation for every Propper agreement task — authenticate, route to the right tool, read the agreement status model, and triage scope and permission errors. Load this before creating, sending, tracking, voiding or importing anything in Propper, and whenever a Propper tool returns an authentication, scope or state error.","headings":["Propper","Authenticate first","Tool routing","Creating an agreement","Status model","Confirm before anything irreversible","Errors","Not legal advice"],"name_hint":"propper"},{"path":"skills/send-for-signature/SKILL.md","name":"send-for-signature","description":"Send a document out for electronic signature end to end — take a PDF or DOCX from disk, a template or generated content, confirm the signers and signing order, place the signature fields, and dispatch it. Use for any request to get something signed, sent for signature, out to a counterparty, or routed for approval and signature.","headings":["Send for signature","Steps","1. Authenticate","2. Locate the source","3. Resolve signers","4. Create the draft","5. Place fields","6. Confirm","7. Send","Generate and send in one call","Create-and-send in one call","Failure handling","Boundary"],"name_hint":"send · for · signature"},{"path":"skills/signature-ready-check/SKILL.md","name":"signature-ready-check","description":"Pre-flight a contract or agreement before anyone signs it — find unfilled blanks and placeholders, inconsistent party and entity names, missing or unattached exhibits, absent signature blocks, and dates that are wrong or stale. Use before sending a document for signature, when asked to check or proof a contract, or when a document is about to go to a counterparty.","headings":["Signature-ready check","Steps","1. Read the document","2. Run the seven checks","3. Report","4. Hand off","Rules","Not legal advice"],"name_hint":"signature · ready · 检查"},{"path":"skills/track-agreements/SKILL.md","name":"track-agreements","description":"Answer where an agreement stands and what to do about it — who has signed, who is holding it up, what is still outstanding across everything in flight, and how to cancel or retrieve a completed copy. Use when someone asks whether a document came back, who has not signed yet, what is waiting on a counterparty, for a sweep of open agreements, or to chase, cancel or download something already sent.","headings":["Track agreements","Steps","1. Authenticate","2. Find it","3. Read the per-recipient detail","4. Diagnose the stall","The outstanding sweep","There is no reminder tool","Cancelling","Retrieving a completed copy","Failure handling","Boundary"],"name_hint":"track · agreements"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["Propper","Install","Claude Code and Cowork","Other agents","pick specific skills","target specific agents","install everything, globally, no prompts","see what is in the repo without installing","Without the tools","Skills","The starter pack","Authentication and scopes","Sending is confirmed, always","Not legal advice","Other agents","Links","Development","License"]}],"mcp_servers":["propper"],"config_names":[],"paths":[".agents/rules/public-repo.md",".agents/skills/contribute-propper-skill/SKILL.md",".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".claude/rules/public-repo.md",".claude/skills/contribute-propper-skill/SKILL.md",".github/CODEOWNERS",".github/pull_request_template.md",".github/workflows/validate.yml",".gitignore",".mcp.json","AGENTS.md","CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md","CONTRIBUTING.md","LICENSE","README.md","SECURITY.md","evals/annotation-draft-and-bounds/graders/criteria.md","evals/annotation-draft-and-bounds/graders/skill-fired.md","evals/annotation-draft-and-bounds/prompt.md","evals/auto-renewal-notice-deadline/graders/criteria.md","evals/auto-renewal-notice-deadline/graders/skill-fired.md","evals/auto-renewal-notice-deadline/prompt.md","evals/chase-stalled-agreement/graders/criteria.md","evals/chase-stalled-agreement/graders/skill-fired.m